                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2421987-f5cb-4450-aa53-4c39bbadb21a",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "I'd like to apologise, unreservedly, to pigs everywhere, but especially those on my farm […] So Hermes pig collars all round to my herd and soz soz soz.",
                                "translation": "我想毫无保留地向世界各地的猪道歉，尤其是我农场里的猪 […] 所以，我要给我的猪群都戴上爱马仕猪项圈，对不起对不起对不起。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bc72e49b-8603-465f-a8d0-d717d94c4693",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "I'm soz about what happened.",
                                "translation": "我对发生的事情感到非常抱歉。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a2bb0341-2537-4fec-8a46-6061efc8aaea",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "Soz Mike, I thought you were showing me a fool proof way of going xna"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "d10d16b6-3910-4b79-bf8a-073c18272d31",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "Soz for bringing it up again, but it is good to have a healthy attitude towards this..!!!!",
                                "translation": "抱歉又提起这件事，但对这件事保持积极的态度是件好事……！！！！"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a912ccb8-3396-45b6-9ef7-0fd5fbc0cff6",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "U2 says soz for online snafu [標題]",
                                "translation": "U2就网络故障表示歉意"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cf2af82a-e9c3-485d-802d-d4a989fa754e",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "Does it auto update when the disc is inserted or will i^([sic]) get the option to ignore the update?¶ Or do i^([sic]) just DL pal games to be on the safe side?¶ Soz for all the questions but wanna make sure I get it right",
                                "translation": "光盘插入后会自动更新吗？还是我可以选择忽略更新？或者为了保险起见，我直接下载PAL制式的游戏？不好意思问了这么多问题，但我只是想确保自己理解正确。"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9d9c321e-730e-47af-b95e-1205032e07d5",
                                "sense_id": "27eff9ec-33fc-3032-80be-4a5c1b3135bd",
                                "text": "“Soz, babe, I should probably mingle and talk to more people. It was so nice to see you, though.” “Ok, maybe we can catch up soon.” “Yeah, I don't know. I'm really busy lately. So, like, yeah, I don't know. Uh, say his to Sarah for me. though.”",
                                "translation": "“抱歉啊宝贝，我应该多跟其他人聊聊天。不过见到你真开心。”“好吧，也许我们能尽快再聚聚。”“嗯，我也不知道。我最近真的很忙。所以，嗯，我也不知道。呃，帮我跟莎拉说一声吧。”"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
